    "Included: host environment, versions, health, logs, runtime and package state — redacted for names, paths, addresses, and secrets. Never collected: file contents, clipboard, keystrokes, or private app data.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Included: host environment, versions, health, logs, runtime and package state — redacted for names, paths, addresses, and secrets. Never collected: file contents, clipboard, keystrokes, or private app data."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "含まれるもの: ホスト環境、バージョン、正常性、ログ、ランタイムとパッケージの状態（名前・パス・アドレス・機密情報はマスク済み）。収集しないもの: ファイルの内容、クリップボード、キー入力、アプリのプライベートデータ。"
